---
source: tests/golden/harness.rs
---
==== the registry
upstream
community
==== the catalog
upstream/base-image/collected  A base only the collection knows about
upstream/base-image/fedora  Fedora, as this collection describes it
community/browser  A browser, from the second collection (requires flatpak)
upstream/browser  A browser, from the first collection
upstream/custom-kernel  A kernel the image pins, swapped in over the base's own
upstream/debian-family  apt and its state directories, which every deb build layer reaches for
upstream/fedora-family  dnf5 and its plugins, which every fedora build layer reaches for
upstream/flatpak  Flatpak client and a daily update timer
upstream/needs-family  A component that needs the family adapter under it (requires build-environment)
upstream/signature-policy  Sigstore signature verification for the image's own updates
==== import flatpak
copied
==== import browser
`browser` names more than one component; name which one, as `community/browser`
==== import upstream/browser
copied
==== import community/browser
`browser` is already in this repository and differs from the library's; run `tect import component` in a terminal to list the local `browser` or import the library's under another name
==== import nosuch
no component called `nosuch` in upstream, community
==== import upstream/nosuch
no component called `nosuch` in upstream
==== import flatpak
`flatpak` is already in this repository; run `tect import component` in a terminal to list the local `flatpak` or import the library's under another name
